{"4463680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dorts : A Darts Roguelike", "steam_appid": 4463680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Its only darts. How hard can it be?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DORTS is a first-person darts roguelike. Beat your opponent at 501, buy upgrades and face the next challenger. Combine upgrades in unique ways to give yourself an edge and try to keep surviving as the disruptions mount and the chaos erupts! How high will you rank on the global leaderboard?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs last 10–15 minutes. You will say &quot;one more go&quot; and mean it every time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What’s in the box : </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of upgrades to draft</strong> - Steady Hand, Glass Cannon, One Dart Wonder. Buy them. Stack them. Break the game. Lose anyway!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of disruptions to survive</strong> - Spinning boards, magnetic pull, shrinking doubles, shuffled numbers and more. The game fights back harder every leg.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leg mutators</strong> - Sprint, Sudden Death, Balloon Party, Whack a Mole. Every leg plays by different rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ opponents across 4 venues</strong> - From Pub Dave in The Den to Tungsten Tony at the Theatre of Dorts. They do not miss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisation &amp; Steamworks Integration</strong> - You can make your own custom runs, darts, boards, venues and even announcer voices! Share your favourites in the Steam Workshop with the community!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Multiplayer</strong> - Compete against your friends and the rest of the Dorts community in 1v1 battles! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career Mode</strong> - Four divisions, seasonal leagues, the World Championship. Start at the Den League, climb to the Pro League.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The oche is waiting. Are you ready?</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Its only darts. How hard can it be?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DORTS is a first-person darts roguelike. Beat your opponent at 501, buy upgrades and face the next challenger. Combine upgrades in unique ways to give yourself an edge and try to keep surviving as the disruptions mount and the chaos erupts! How high will you rank on the global leaderboard?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs last 10–15 minutes. You will say &quot;one more go&quot; and mean it every time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What’s in the box : </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of upgrades to draft</strong> - Steady Hand, Glass Cannon, One Dart Wonder. Buy them. Stack them. Break the game. Lose anyway!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tons of disruptions to survive</strong> - Spinning boards, magnetic pull, shrinking doubles, shuffled numbers and more. The game fights back harder every leg.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leg mutators</strong> - Sprint, Sudden Death, Balloon Party, Whack a Mole. Every leg plays by different rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ opponents across 4 venues</strong> - From Pub Dave in The Den to Tungsten Tony at the Theatre of Dorts. They do not miss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customisation &amp; Steamworks Integration</strong> - You can make your own custom runs, darts, boards, venues and even announcer voices! Share your favourites in the Steam Workshop with the community!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Multiplayer</strong> - Compete against your friends and the rest of the Dorts community in 1v1 battles! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Career Mode</strong> - Four divisions, seasonal leag